# Audit Log Schema

```json
{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "RAG Query Audit Log",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "event_id",
    "timestamp",
    "user_id",
    "query_hash",
    "retrieved_chunk_ids",
    "model",
    "latency_ms",
    "tier_filter_applied",
    "answer_generated"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "event_id": { "type": "string" },
    "timestamp": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
    "user_id": { "type": "string" },
    "query_hash": { "type": "string", "description": "SHA-256 of the raw question (PII-safe)" },
    "retrieved_chunk_ids": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
    "model": { "type": "string" },
    "latency_ms": { "type": "integer" },
    "tier_filter_applied": { "type": "boolean" },
    "answer_generated": { "type": "boolean" },
    "refusal_reason": { "type": "string" }
  }
}
```

## Retention
- Keep audit logs for at least 12 months.
- Logs are append-only; no updates or deletes.

